	(text "VSYS    - external power input, feeds onboard 3.3V regulator\nVBUS    - raw USB 5V passthrough, only live when USB-powered\n3V3_EN  - pull LOW to hard-cut all power (RAM lost)\nADC_REF - ADC reference, internally tied to 3V3 already\nRUN     - reset pin, pull LOW to restart (RAM kept)\n \nGP23/24/25/29 - DO NOT USE, internal CYW43 WiFi chip\n\nSWCLK/SWDIO - To Pinheader for Debug-Probe\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
